---
// CTA section - final call to action
---

<section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card" data-reveal>
      <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2 id="cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        Empieza a gestionar<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">tu dinero hoy</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-subtitle">
        Gratuito, sin anuncios, sin acceso a tus datos bancarios. Solo tú y el control total de tus finanzas.
      </p>
      <a href="https://wallet-wise.devcodewolf.com" class="btn-primary btn-lg" rel="noopener">
        Empezar gratis
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14"/>
          <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  .cta-card {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-glow), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw + 0.5rem, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cta-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .cta .btn-primary {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 0.875rem 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta {
      padding: 3rem 1rem 5rem;
    }
    .cta-card {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
